    Question: 
        If I had to make a table to assign at most one parking permit to each 
        employee at a time. I would make permit and attribute of the employee table.
        There is no need to create anything else as an employee can own a permit but 
        the permit doesn't need to exist outside of that. I would also create
        permit price and parking location attributes to the employees. 

        If multiple permits could be assigned to multiple employees at once, I would then
        have to make a completely different table to manage the information of permits.
        This is because I would have to store much more information. We would also store
        who owns the permit as this information is no longer stored in the empoyees table. 
        We would also need to include all the other information about the permits from the
        employees table as well. This relationship would be 1 to many. Many employees can one 
        employee per permit.

